{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MatomoDimensions","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Matomo numbers the custom dimensions of a site as they are made, in its settings (Administration,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Websites, Custom Dimensions), and reads a request’s "},{"code":"dimension3","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" as the value of dimension 3, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the mapping comes from the app:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let dimensions: MatomoDimensions = [\"plan\": 1, \"seats\": 2]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A property is mapped by its name, the same in every event of the plan that has it. A property"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no mapping names is never sent, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoDimensions\/unmappedProperties(in:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists those of a plan, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the encoder logs once when it is made."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A literal doesn’t check anything, so it can’t fail: the destination’s factory checks the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mapping against the plan, and throws "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoSetupError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" for a dimension ID below 1, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property mapped twice, a property no event of the plan has, a property that is "},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an event, and two properties of one event mapped to one dimension."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/matomoencoding\/matomodimensions"]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoDimensions\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoDimensions\/init(dictionaryLiteral:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoDimensions\/unmappedProperties(in:)"],"generated":true}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoDimensions","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding"]]},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MatomoDimensions","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"MatomoEncoding"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoDimensions.swift#L25","fileName":"MatomoDimensions.swift"},"title":"MatomoDimensions","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MatomoDimensions","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:14MatomoEncoding0A10DimensionsV"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/s30ExpressibleByDictionaryLiteralP","doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Which of Matomo’s custom dimensions each property of a tracking plan is sent as, by the","type":"text"},